<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 368-7 V ZIMBABWE (375) AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 368-7 V ZIMBABWE (375) AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani were 368</p>
<p>for seven at tea on the third day of the first cricket test</p>
<p>against Zimbabwe on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 375; Pakistan 368-7.</p>
</text>
